<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Campaign Validation</strong>: The system validates all campaign =
sections before allowing the Admin to submit the campaign.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Submission Confirmation</strong>: Once submitted, the campaign s=
tatus is updated to "Submitted" and is processed according to the configure=
d schedule.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Security Handling</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Control</strong>: Only authorized users (admins) can revi=
ew and submit campaigns.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Data Security</strong>: All campaign data is securely stored and=
 accessible only to authorized users.</p></li>
</ul>
